s for Dubai.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca:u000017"}], "text": "Dubai's real estate market follows a cycle that includes the phases of recovery, expansion, hyper supply, and recession, which typically lasts seven to nine years."}, "title": "Dubai Real Estate Cycles", "topic": "real_estate_cycles"}, "content_hash": "a8cf6b1a46a4a7cecdc3a5d90b3347a6fdc5af61b611f57ae3b9df294b89f0cc", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca:knowledge:3cbd82306f157347", "metadata_hash": "d2220344c640089948add7a50a6d5ac59e142b0463c9fc79fb99513792858624", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-09-10", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "c6de24aaad820ae56f1951829b3c28b60645b017ca33168bc15ef4f0fe5e2610", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fpjQdsJSLCM", "title": "Dubai Real Estate Cycles", "topic": "real_estate_cycles", "topic_slug": "real_estate_cycles"}
