 now and twenty twenty nine.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca:u000033"}, {"quote": "The heaviest year is twenty twenty seven, and eighty seven percent of it is apartments.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca:u000033"}], "text": "Dubai is projected to have around 440,000 homes scheduled between now and 2029, with the heaviest year being 2027, where 87% of the supply is expected to be apartments."}, "title": "Housing Over Supply Issue", "topic": "real_estate_supply"}, "content_hash": "a8cf6b1a46a4a7cecdc3a5d90b3347a6fdc5af61b611f57ae3b9df294b89f0cc", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca:knowledge:bb3dfbb707e89da9", "metadata_hash": "d2220344c640089948add7a50a6d5ac59e142b0463c9fc79fb99513792858624", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-09-10", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "c6de24aaad820ae56f1951829b3c28b60645b017ca33168bc15ef4f0fe5e2610", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fpjQdsJSLCM", "title": "Housing Over Supply Issue", "topic": "real_estate_supply", "topic_slug": "real_estate_supply"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca:u000035", "youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca:u000036"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Over supply is really a city problem. It's a building problem.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca:u000036"}, {"quote": "Three hundred owners list for rent in the same week.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca:u000035"}], "text": "Investors are cautioned that oversupply is not just a citywide issue but also a building-specific problem when multiple identical units are listed simultaneously."}, "title": "Investor Caution", "topic": "real_estate_investment"}, "content_hash": "a8cf6b1a46a4a7cecdc3a5d90b3347a6fdc5af61b611f57ae3b9df294b89f0cc", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca:knowledge:89c2b70430f66c96", "metadata_hash": "d2220344c640089948add7a50a6d5ac59e142b0463c9fc79fb99513792858624", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-09-10", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "c6de24aaad820ae56f1951829b3c28b60645b017ca33168bc15ef4f0fe5e2610", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fpjQdsJSLCM", "title": "Investor Caution", "topic": "real_estate_investment", "topic_slug": "real_estate_investment"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca:u000030", "youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca:u000031", "youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca:u000032", "youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca:u000033"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "In two thousand eight it ran on ninety percent loans. Today most purchases are cash.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca:u000030"}, {"quote": "It's very hard for a cash market to have a heart attack.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca:u000030"}], "text": "The 2008 market was largely powered by credit, whereas the current market relies more on cash purchases, making it less prone to collapse from a lack of lending."}, "title": "2008 vs 2026 Market Comparison", "topic": "market_comparison"}, "content_hash": "a8cf6b1a46a4a7cecdc3a5d90b3347a6fdc5af61b611f57ae3b9df294b89f0cc", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca:knowledge:fc986c9c4623fae4", "metadata_hash": "d2220344c640089948add7a50a6d5ac59e142b0463c9fc79fb99513792858624", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-09-10", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "c6de24aaad820ae56f1951829b3c28b60645b017ca33168bc15ef4f0fe5e2610", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fpjQdsJSLCM", "title": "2008 vs 2026 Market Comparison", "topic": "market_comparison", "topic_slug": "market_comparison"}
